@UnifiedDocuments_HostAddress = http://localhost:5268
@vin = 1HGCM82633A004352

### Search documents for a VIN
GET {{UnifiedDocuments_HostAddress}}/vehicles/{{vin}}/documents
Accept: application/json

###

### Suggest VINs matching a prefix or fragment
GET {{UnifiedDocuments_HostAddress}}/vehicles/identifiers?query=1HGCM
Accept: application/json

###

### First page of documents without a detected VIN
GET {{UnifiedDocuments_HostAddress}}/documents/unlinked?pageSize=50
Accept: application/json

###

### Next page: replace the cursor value with nextCursor from the previous response
@unlinkedCursor = replace-with-nextCursor
GET {{UnifiedDocuments_HostAddress}}/documents/unlinked?pageSize=50&cursor={{unlinkedCursor}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Download an original document (replace the source and ID with a search result)
GET {{UnifiedDocuments_HostAddress}}/documents/Sales/example-document-id/content?download=true
